  "content": {
    "title": "Selena Gomez Goes ’60s Mod in a Brand-New Prada Minidress",
    "text": "This article contains affiliate links; if you click such a link and make a purchase, we may earn a commission.Selena Gomez Looks Very Mod in Brand-New PradaStefanie Keenan - Getty Images (Stefanie Keenan - Getty Images)Is that the new Prada I see? Now that the Spring/Summer 2026 collections are finally available to purchase, many of us have found ourselves catching the shopping bug and embracing the season, including, it seems, Selena Gomez.On Thursday evening, the Emmy nominee celebrated the release of a new “True to Myself” natural matte long-wear foundation through her cosmetics brand Rare Beauty, with a special event at the West Hollywood Edition hotel. And what better occasion than a launch to unveil a brand-new look, too?Selena Gomez celebrates the launch of a new Rare Beauty product at the West Hollywood Edition hotel.Stefanie Keenan - Getty Images (Stefanie Keenan - Getty Images)To the event, Gomez wore a metallic bubblegum-pink minidress from the Prada Spring/Summer 2026 ready-to-wear collection by Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons. The wool and silk design featured a mod-inspired minimalist silhouette, and it was defined by visible seams and large flap pockets in the front.Look 22 from the Prada Spring/Summer 2026 ready-to-wear collection.launchmetrics.com/spotlight - LAUNCHMETRICS SPOTLIGHT (launchmetrics.com/spotlight - LAUNCHMETRICS SPOTLIGHT)Shop NowPrada Embellished Wool and Silk Minidressmytheresa.comMI - Big Rapids NewsAt the waist, the dress flared out ever-so-slightly thanks to a crinkly white crinoline-esque material underneath, and up top, the ensemble was given a sandwich effect thanks to white pearl embellishments that coated the crew neckline.Gomez winked to these white details by slipping into a pair of milky leather slingbacks, also from Prada, adorned with skinny bows on the sides of the vamps.Gomez wore a metallic pink Prada dress and jewelry from Effy jewelry for the occasion.Stefanie Keenan - Getty Images (Stefanie Keenan - Getty Images)She completed the look with large white-gold hoop earrings and diamond rings from Effy jewelry, while tying her hair up into a tight bun, leaving a few strands hanging down to frame her face.One thing any of us can understand is that when you’re excited about a new outfit, you’ll waste no time in finding an excuse to wear it.You Might Also Like",
